    "title": "MiniMax-H3 SP head buckets reduce exposed All-to-All with quality still pending",
    "summary": "An open Ascend head-bucket pipeline overlaps projection/attention with communication; reported latency improves against the same-round chunk path, but full-model output equivalence remains unproven.",
